<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/public-head', { pageTitle: 'About us', pageDescription: 'Meet Barangay Malimba’s health staff and learn about our mission, vision, and commitment to our community in Gapan City, Nueva Ecija.', pageStyles: ['/css/about.css'] }) %>
<body class="landing-page public-page about-page">
    <%- include('partials/public-header', { currentPage: 'about' }) %>

    <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
        <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
            <div class="page-container">
                <nav class="page-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <a href="/">Home</a>
                    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
                    <span aria-current="page">About us</span>
                </nav>
                <div class="page-hero-grid">
                    <div class="page-hero-copy">
                        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT BARANGAY MALIMBA</p>
                        <h1 id="about-title">Our community.<br><span>Our shared commitment.</span></h1>
                        <p>Meet the people behind our barangay services and the purpose that guides us: a safe, healthy, and thriving Malimba for all.</p>
                        <div class="hero-actions">
                            <a href="#health-team" class="button button-primary">Meet our health team <i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-arrow-right"/></svg></i></a>
                            <a href="/contact" class="button button-outline">Get in touch</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <figure class="page-hero-visual about-hero-photo">
                        <img src="/images/b.jpg" alt="Barangay Malimba community members gathered together at a covered court" width="2048" height="1536" fetchpriority="high">
                        <figcaption class="page-hero-caption"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-people-group"/></svg></i> Serving Malimba, together.</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-introduction" aria-labelledby="commitment-title">
            <div class="page-container about-introduction-grid">
                <div>
                    <p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE FIRST, ALWAYS</p>
                    <h2 id="commitment-title">Compassionate service.<br>Closer to home.</h2>
                </div>
                <p>Our dedicated teams are committed to delivering efficient and compassionate services that support the well-being of all residents. Through our programs and initiatives, we work toward a safe, healthy, and thriving community.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section page-muted-section" aria-labelledby="purpose-title">
            <div class="page-container">
                <div class="page-section-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION &amp; VISION</p>
                    <h2 id="purpose-title">A clear purpose.<br>A healthier community.</h2>
                    <p>These commitments guide the work of Barangay Malimba Health Station.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="direction-grid">
                    <article class="direction-card">
                        <div class="direction-heading">
                            <span class="direction-icon"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-heart"/></svg></i></span>
                            <div><span class="direction-label">WHAT WE DO</span><h3>Our mission</h3></div>
                        </div>
                        <img class="direction-image" src="/images/Mission.jpg" alt="Barangay Malimba mission statement" width="1366" height="768" loading="lazy">
                        <p class="direction-copy">To provide accessible, compassionate, and high-quality health care services for all ages in our community.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="direction-card">
                        <div class="direction-heading">
                            <span class="direction-icon direction-icon-green"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-seedling"/></svg></i></span>
                            <div><span class="direction-label">WHERE WE ARE HEADED</span><h3>Our vision</h3></div>
                        </div>
                        <img class="direction-image" src="/images/Vision.jpg" alt="Barangay Malimba vision statement" width="1366" height="768" loading="lazy">
                        <p class="direction-copy">We envision Barangay Malimba Health Station as our main health care provider, delivering basic primary health care and quality services for all.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section health-team-section" id="health-team" aria-labelledby="health-team-title">
            <div class="page-container">
                <div class="page-section-heading health-team-heading">
                    <div><p class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE CARE</p><h2 id="health-team-title">Meet our barangay health staff.</h2><p>Our nutrition scholar and health workers are here for the Malimba community.</p></div>
                    <span class="health-team-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-shield-heart"/></svg></i></span>
                </div>
                <% const healthStaff = [
                    { name: 'BNS Chona P Santos', initials: 'CS', role: 'BNS', description: 'Barangay Nutrition Scholar', phone: '0991 343 3708' },
                    { name: 'BHW Jerelene Perido', initials: 'JP', role: 'BHW', description: 'Barangay Health Worker', phone: '0977 142 8227' },
                    { name: 'BHW Maricel Jimenez', initials: 'MJ', role: 'BHW', description: 'Barangay Health Worker', phone: '0967 550 3616' },
                    { name: 'BHW Rochelle Cruz', initials: 'RC', role: 'BHW', description: 'Barangay Health Worker', phone: '0953 904 5972' },
                    { name: 'BHW Elma Miranda', initials: 'EM', role: 'BHW', description: 'Barangay Health Worker', phone: '0935 108 9986' },
                    { name: 'BHW Aireen Ayroso', initials: 'AA', role: 'BHW', description: 'Barangay Health Worker', phone: '0966 930 3091' }
                ]; %>
                <div class="health-staff-grid">
                    <% healthStaff.forEach(function(member) { %>
                        <article class="staff-card">
                            <div class="staff-card-top"><span class="staff-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><%= member.initials %></span><span class="staff-role <%= member.role === 'BNS' ? 'staff-role-nutrition' : '' %>"><%= member.role %></span></div>
                            <h3 class="staff-name"><%= member.name %></h3>
                            <p class="staff-description"><%= member.description %></p>
                            <div class="staff-phone"><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-phone"/></svg></i><span><%= member.phone %></span></div>
                        </article>
                    <% }); %>
                </div>

                <figure class="barangay-team-banner">
                    <img src="/images/members.jpg" alt="Barangay team members featured in the Team De Guzman and Team Sebastian banner" width="3316" height="1264" loading="lazy">
                    <figcaption><span class="team-banner-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-people-group"/></svg></i></span><div><h3>Our barangay teams</h3><p>Working together to serve our residents and support the well-being of our community.</p></div></figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="cta-section about-cta" aria-labelledby="about-cta-title">
            <div class="page-container"><div class="cta-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">WE ARE HERE TO HELP</p><h2 id="about-cta-title">Let’s keep our community connected.</h2><p>Have a question about our services? Get in touch with the barangay team.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a href="/contact" class="button button-white">Contact our team <i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false"><use href="#icon-arrow-right"/></svg></i></a><a href="/users/schedule" class="cta-help" data-open-login>Request an appointment</a></div></div></div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/public-footer') %>
    <%- include('partials/public-auth') %>
</body>
</html>
